# Remnants of Naezith reads the controller directly (buttons and D-pad), so those are not mapped
# here. Its stick input only reads the X and Y axes, and handhelds like the Anbernic H700 ones
# report the left stick on other axes, so the left stick is mapped to the arrow keys, which the
# game also uses for moving and for the menus. gptokeyb also supplies the exit hotkey.
